      522.01,
      295.09,
      581.08
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 ofLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the land acquisitionamendment act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Governmentintended to acquire the following land or servitude which isrequired for public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      588.01,
      295.33,
      671.08
    ],
    "text": "Below mentioned land depicted as lot No. 01 in plan no.PP/MR/2774 situated in the Village of Katuwangoda, inMalimbada Divisional Secretariat Division, in MataraDistrict in Southern province was acquired for theconstruction of Uninduwela water purifier, storage that,Administration building, Factory and office quarters underMatara 4th step of water supply scheme.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
